    "detailed_description": "Cursed House 4 is the first game that can be called a Match 3 Puzzle. It's important not just to mindlessly create combinations, but to think about the sequence in which to do everything. This game features a new bonus system, levels where you can get stuck if not played correctly, and special challenge levels that players can choose to play and replay. These levels require some thought!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n100 Match 3 levels needed to rid the house of ghosts<br />\r\n50 optional challenge Match 3 levels of special difficulty<br />\r\n9 Spot the difference scenes<br />\r\nA mansion ruined by ghosts that needs to be restored and cleansed of evil spirits",
